.TH ORO-TEST 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:test \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:test'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Provides a test runner for Oro Runtime.
.PP
Example usage: import { test } from 'oro:test'
.PP
test('test name', async t => { t.equal(1, 1) })
