.br
\fIparentSelector\fR (string \\| HTMLElement \\| Element; required) A CSS selector string, or an instance of HTMLElement, or Element to appendChild on.
.br
\fIel\fR (HTMLElement \\| Element; required) A element to append to the parent element.
.br
\fImsg\fR (string; optional; default 'Appended child element')
\fBReturns:\fR
