\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIquerySelectorOrFn\fR (string \\| (() => HTMLElement \\| Element \\| null \\| undefined); required) A query string or a function that returns an element.
.br
\fIopts\fR (Object; optional)
.br
\fIopts.visible\fR (boolean; optional) The element needs to be visible.
.br
\fIopts.timeout\fR (number; optional) The maximum amount of time to wait.
.br
\fImsg\fR (string; optional)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<HTMLElement \\| Element \\| void>\fR
.TP
\fBwaitForText(selector, opts, msg)\fR
Test if an element is invisible
.br
