.br
await t.waitForText('#dom\-selector', { text: 'Text to wait for', multipleTags: true })
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIselector\fR (string \\| HTMLElement \\| Element; required) A CSS selector string, or an instance of HTMLElement, or Element.
.br
\fIopts\fR (WaitForTextOpts \\| string \\| RegExp; optional)
.br
\fImsg\fR (string; optional)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<HTMLElement \\| Element \\| void>\fR
